    "steam_appid": 2505370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505370/extras/f059489722cd1a4022ad126399ab5305.avif?t=1748895980\" /></span><br>Be the savior or the scourge of the universe. Defeat the pirate scum and fend off a minor invasion force assembled by the Javelin Pirates.<br><br>Follow the Federation's anti-invasion checklist to survive.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Grab Your Friends<br></li><li> Grab Some Guns<br></li><li> Grab A Spaceship<br></li><li> Upgrade the Guns<br></li><li> Upgrade the Spaceship<br></li><li> Upgrade the Upgrades<br></li><li> Recruit Colonists<br></li><li> Show No Mercy</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505370/extras/f059489722cd1a4022ad126399ab5305.avif?t=1748895980\" /></span><br>Be the savior or the scourge of the universe. Defeat the pirate scum and fend off a minor invasion force assembled by the Javelin Pirates.<br><br>Follow the Federation's anti-invasion checklist to survive.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Grab Your Friends<br></li><li> Grab Some Guns<br></li><li> Grab A Spaceship<br></li><li> Upgrade the Guns<br></li><li> Upgrade the Spaceship<br></li><li> Upgrade the Upgrades<br></li><li> Recruit Colonists<br></li><li> Show No Mercy</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Future Weapon Online is an online space shooter where you can host a server for you and your friends to annihilate the universe together. Grab a gun, grab a spaceship, explore the universe, punch rocks, upgrade everything, and recruit a fleet of warships to wreck everything in your path.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
